flowchart TD
 A[Select coordinate] --> B{Cell empty or owned by active player?}
 B -- No --> X[Reject without state mutation]
 B -- Yes --> C[Increment orb count]
 C --> D[Assign active owner]
 D --> E{Critical mass reached?}
 E -- No --> F[Finish move]
 E -- Yes --> G[Process unstable cell]
 G --> H[Distribute to orthogonal neighbors]
 H --> I[Transfer ownership]
 I --> J{More unstable cells?}
 J -- Yes --> G
 J -- No --> F
 F --> K[Evaluate result and advance turn]
